margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>VI.- SATA&#350;MALARA
&#304;L&#304;&#350;K&#304;N KONU&#350;MALAR<o:p></o:p></span></p>

