style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt'>MERAL DANI&#350;
BE&#350;TA&#350; (Siirt) – Gelece&#287;im, sabredin, ona da gelece&#287;im. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=GENELKURUL style='line-height:normal'><span lang=X-NONE
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt'>“Kürt halk&#305;” derken
